              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "pōtor, pōtōris — \"a drinker, a heavy drinker\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In tabernā pōtōrēs multum vīnum bibunt. In the tavern the drinkers drink a lot of wine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Third declension, masculine: pōtor, pōtōris m., from the same root as pōtus 'drunk'."
            }
          ]
